---
/* L24 - from logits to a decision: temperature moves the shares, the threshold decides. */
---

<figure class="fig">
  <div class="fig__frame">
    <img
      class="fig__picture"
      src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}illustrations/L24.jpg`}
      alt="A line drawing of three identical weighing scales standing in a row, each holding round weights stacked differently, with a dashed chalk line drawn across the wall behind them that the tallest stack on the first scale rises past and the last one falls short of."
    />
    <svg
      class="fig__svg"
      viewBox="0 0 640 340"
      role="img"
      aria-labelledby="L24-fig-title L24-fig-desc"
    >
      <title id="L24-fig-title">The same ranking at three temperatures, and one threshold</title>
      <desc id="L24-fig-desc">
        Three bar groups side by side, one per temperature: 0.1, 1.0 and 5.0.
        Each group has three bars for billing, technical and other, and billing
        is the tallest bar in all three groups, so the ranking never changes.
        A horizontal dashed line at 0.6 is the action threshold. At temperature
        0.1 the billing bar stands at 0.9999, well above the line; at 1.0 it
        stands at 0.6285 and clears the line narrowly; at 5.0 it has fallen to
        0.3907, below the line, and the verdict reads did not act. A marker
        travels down from the height the billing bar had at temperature 1.0 to
        the height it has at 5.0, crossing the threshold on the way.
      </desc>

      <!-- the axes -->
      <g class="fig-axis">
        <path d="M56 300 H616 M56 300 V50" />
      </g>
      <text x="22" y="54" class="fig-text fig-text--dim">1.0</text>
      <text x="22" y="158" class="fig-text fig-text--dim">0.6</text>
      <text x="22" y="304" class="fig-text fig-text--dim">0.0</text>

      <!-- the action threshold -->
      <g class="fig-threshold">
        <path d="M56 154 H616" />
      </g>
      <text x="56" y="148" class="fig-text fig-text--ink">threshold 0.6</text>

      <!-- group 1: T = 0.1 -->
      <g>
        <text x="86" y="36" class="fig-label">T = 0.1</text>
        <rect class="fig-bar fig-bar--ink" x="86" y="56" width="34" height="244" />
        <rect class="fig-bar fig-bar--weak" x="126" y="299" width="34" height="1" />
        <rect class="fig-bar fig-bar--weak" x="166" y="299" width="34" height="1" />
        <text x="88" y="72" class="fig-text fig-text--num fig-text--on">0.9999</text>
        <text x="76" y="316" class="fig-text fig-text--dim">billing</text>
        <text x="122" y="316" class="fig-text fig-text--dim">tech</text>
        <text x="168" y="316" class="fig-text fig-text--dim">other</text>
        <text x="76" y="332" class="fig-text fig-text--dim">both others below 0.0001</text>
        <text x="86" y="238" class="fig-text fig-text--on fig-text--num">acted</text>
      </g>

      <!-- group 2: T = 1.0 -->
      <g>
        <text x="266" y="36" class="fig-label">T = 1.0</text>
        <rect class="fig-bar fig-bar--ink" x="266" y="147" width="34" height="153" />
        <rect class="fig-bar fig-bar--mid" x="306" y="244" width="34" height="56" />
        <rect class="fig-bar fig-bar--weak" x="346" y="266" width="34" height="34" />
        <text x="268" y="163" class="fig-text fig-text--num fig-text--on">0.6285</text>
        <text x="256" y="316" class="fig-text fig-text--dim">billing</text>
        <text x="302" y="316" class="fig-text fig-text--dim">tech</text>
        <text x="348" y="316" class="fig-text fig-text--dim">other</text>
        <text x="256" y="332" class="fig-text fig-text--dim">0.2312 / 0.1402</text>
        <text x="266" y="238" class="fig-text fig-text--on fig-text--num">acted</text>
      </g>

      <!-- group 3: T = 5.0 -->
      <g>
        <text x="446" y="36" class="fig-label">T = 5.0</text>
        <rect class="fig-bar fig-bar--ink" x="446" y="205" width="34" height="95" />
        <rect class="fig-bar fig-bar--mid" x="486" y="222" width="34" height="78" />
        <rect class="fig-bar fig-bar--weak" x="526" y="229" width="34" height="71" />
        <text x="448" y="221" class="fig-text fig-text--num fig-text--on">0.3907</text>
        <text x="436" y="316" class="fig-text fig-text--dim">billing</text>
        <text x="482" y="316" class="fig-text fig-text--dim">tech</text>
        <text x="528" y="316" class="fig-text fig-text--dim">other</text>
        <text x="436" y="332" class="fig-text fig-text--dim">0.3199 / 0.2894</text>
        <text x="446" y="238" class="fig-text fig-text--ink fig-text--num">did not act</text>
      </g>

      <!-- where billing stood at T = 1.0, and the drop to T = 5.0 -->
      <g class="fig-ref">
        <path d="M436 147 H612" />
      </g>
      <text x="436" y="142" class="fig-text fig-text--dim">billing at T = 1.0</text>
      <g class="m-draw fig-drop" style="--m-length: 210; --m-duration: 1.6s">
        <path d="M496 147 V205 M490 147 H502 M490 205 H502" />
      </g>
      <g class="m-drop fig-marker">
        <circle cx="496" cy="147" r="4" />
      </g>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption class="fig__caption">
    <span class="edge-code">figure L24</span>
    <span class="fig__caption-text">Raising the temperature flattens the shares without reordering the options, and at temperature 5.0 the top option has fallen below the 0.6 action threshold.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .fig-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.09em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    fill: var(--color-ink-45);
  }

  .fig-text {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    fill: var(--color-ink-70);
  }

  .fig-text--ink {
    fill: var(--color-ink);
  }

  .fig-text--dim {
    fill: var(--color-ink-45);
  }

  .fig-text--num {
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }

  .fig-text--on {
    fill: var(--color-ground);
  }

  .fig-axis path {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--color-rule);
    stroke-width: 1;
  }

  .fig-threshold path {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--color-prussian);
    stroke-width: 1;
    stroke-dasharray: 5 4;
  }

  .fig-ref path {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--color-rule);
    stroke-width: 1;
    stroke-dasharray: 2 3;
  }

  .fig-bar {
    stroke: none;
  }

  .fig-bar--ink {
    fill: var(--color-prussian);
  }

  .fig-bar--mid {
    fill: var(--color-prussian-tint);
  }

  .fig-bar--weak {
    fill: var(--color-rule);
  }

  .fig-drop path {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--color-ink);
    stroke-width: 1;
  }

  .fig-marker circle {
    fill: var(--color-ink);
  }

  /* the one idea of motion: the marker travels down through the threshold */
  @keyframes l24-drop {
    from {
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
    to {
      transform: translateY(58px);
    }
  }

  .fig-marker {
    animation: l24-drop 1.8s ease-in-out 0.5s both;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .fig-marker {
      animation: none !important;
      transform: none;
    }
  }
</style>
